{
  "app_id": 4183770,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "CELESTAY is your new work companion, one you can leave quietly at the edge of your desktop. You can trade the fish you catch for resources and useful items. You can build your home using fish and wood gathered through fishing. As your home grows higher, the scenery you can see will begin to change. As your house grows taller, constellations once hidden from view begin to appear. What awaits beyond that sky...? — Witness the story of the stars."
  },
